comments:
@gumandy Interesting use-case.  By not being able to take advantage of the ThreadLocal, you are probably impacting your acquistion performance by 10x.

Can you define the System property ``com.zaxxer.hikari.useWeakReferences=true`` to see if that fixes the memory leak?

I can investigate a fix for limiting the ThreadPool List length to the size of the pool, but as I said, you're paying a pretty big performance penality by not being able to take advantage of the ThreadLocal during acquisition.

